-- FG circuit pilot S2s: port of Tools.ShippingChildComposeC onto the context-predicate bundles (RefLawsAOpsX / RefLawsATeleX); generated by a rename-only script (names + suffix X, `AdmCtx O.quiet` -> `O.adm`). No sorry/axiom/native_decide/TRUSTED/law.

/-! # The JQCX depth induction with the handler premises discharged inside each step

Same shape as `Tools.ShippingChildComposeA` at `I := JQCX O D`. Inside the step at `D`, from
`hC : ChildKeepsCX O D` (= `ChildSynthAX O (JQCX O D)`):

    hC ─(D2 childEntryA_JQC_of_childSynthAX)→ ChildEntryAX O (JQCX D)
       ─(B legacyImplA_of_teleX, A canonKeyAX, T)→ LegacyImplAX O (JQCX D)
       ─(A legacyCachedA_of_implX)→ LegacyCachedAX;  C projFieldNameAX T → ProjFieldNameAX
       ─(D fromConst_frontends_of_handlersX, generic in I, hsv = JQ half of JQCX)→ BodyKeepsCX O D

Everything used is generic in `I` (`StableA O.quiet I`); nothing is JQ-only. The handlers are
NOT assumed `∀ D` up front. -/

namespace Tools.ShippingChildComposeC
open Lean Meta
open Tools.ShippingEntrySoundness
